"How to Write a Telegram Ad That Gets Clicks (with Examples)": "",
"› Write a Telegram ad": "",
"How to write a Telegram ad that gets clicks": "",
"A sponsored post is read in a few seconds, between other posts. One clear promise, one image and one button do most of the work.": "",
"📢 Write my ad now": "",
"The structure that works": "",
"A hook": "",
"in the first line: a question, a number or a promise that speaks to the channel's readers.": "",
"What they get": "",
": one benefit, said simply.": "",
"A proof": "",
": a figure, a result, a short quote.": "",
"One button": "",
"that says exactly what happens when they tap it.": "",
"Keep it short": "",
"Three to six short lines are enough. On PostPay, an ad with a photo is limited to 1024 characters and an ad with text only to 3500 characters. Use line breaks and one or two emojis to make it easy to scan.": "",
"The button": "",
"1 to 40 characters, starting with a verb: \"Join the channel\", \"Try the bot\", \"Get the guide\"": "",
"A link to your channel (t.me/yourchannel), your bot or your website": "",
"One button only: a single choice gets more clicks": "",
"The image": "",
"A clear image or short video stops the scroll. Show the result or the product, with little text on the image. Avoid images that look like a scam or a fake giveaway.": "",
"Example": "",
"Before:": "",
"\"Hello everyone, we have a new channel about crypto with lots of interesting content, please subscribe, thanks!\"": "",
"After:": "",
"\"📉 Most traders lose money on their first 10 trades. Our channel posts one simple setup a day, with the entry and the stop. 4,000 readers already follow it.\" Button: \"Join the channel\"": "",
"Adapt it to each channel": "",
"Write as the channel writes: its readers are used to its tone. A short version for a news channel, a more detailed one for a guide channel. Test two versions on two small channels and keep the one with the best cost per click.": "",
"What gets refused": "",
"Scams, fake giveaways, adult content and requests for seed phrases are refused automatically. The channel owner can also refuse an ad that does not fit their channel.": "",
